'''Gold Ingot''' is a {{Common}} resource obtained from [[mining]] [[Gold Ore]] at the {{Zone|Gold Mine}}, {{Zone|Gunpowder Mines}}, or mining Pure Gold at the [[Dwarven Mines]] or [[Crystal Hollows]]. It can also be obtained from {{Item Display|Gold Minion!Gold Minions}}, or bought from NPCs for {{c|6}} from the {{NPCSprite|Mine Merchant}}; or for {{C|5.5}} from the {{NPCSprite|Gold Forger}}.

== Collection ==
Collecting gold ingots increases the player's gold ingot [[Collections|collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of gold ingots.

{{/Collection UI}}

{{CollectionTable|Gold Ingot}}

== Obtaining ==

=== Mining ===
Mining [[Gold Ore]] using a [[Pickaxe]] with [[Smelting Touch]] will drop a Gold Ingot. [[Gold Ore]] can be found and mined in the {{Zone|Gold Mine}} and the {{Zone|Gunpowder Mines}}.

==== Pure Gold ====
Pure Gold will always drop Gold Ingots even without [[Smelting Touch]]. A [[Pickaxe]] with a {{Statname|BP}} of {{Green|3}} or better is required to mine it. 

Pure Gold is located both in [[Dwarven Mines]]' {{Zone|Royal Mines}} and [[Crystal Hollows]]'s {{Zone|Mines of Divan}}. It drops {{Item|Gold Ingot|amount=5}}s. It is affected by {{Ench|Compact}} and {{Statname|Mining Spread}}.

It takes the appearance of {{Item|Block of Gold}}.

