=== [[The Alchemist's Staff]] ===
{{Item|The Alchemist's Staff}} requires giving {{Item|Gold Ingot|amount=64}} to {{NPCSprite|Baar}} or the {{NPCSprite|Alchemage}}.

=== Golden Dragon Pet ===
The {{AN|Shining Scales}} ability of {{Item|Golden Dragon Pet}} provides {{stat|str|11.1}} and {{stat|mf|2.2}} per every digit in the Gold Ingot collection, up to {{stat|str|100}} and {{stat|mf|20}} as {{Green|100,000,000}} is limit to the ability.

